{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"a668b4b6547e2ee24f3b6e74327236fef85ba56c9634c2dd8acf5b518e6a27b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["掃羅逝世"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人與以色列人爭戰，以色列人在非利士人面前逃跑，在基利波山有被殺仆倒的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人緊追掃羅和他兒子們，就殺了掃羅的兒子約拿單、亞比拿達、麥基舒亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["勢派甚大，掃羅被弓箭手追上，射傷甚重，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就吩咐拿他兵器的人說：「你拔出刀來，將我刺死，免得那些未受割禮的人來凌辱我。」但拿兵器的人甚懼怕，不肯刺他；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["掃羅就自己伏在刀上死了。拿兵器的人見掃羅已死，也伏在刀上死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["這樣，掃羅和他三個兒子，並他的全家都一同死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住平原的以色列眾人見以色列軍兵逃跑，掃羅和他兒子都死了，也就棄城逃跑，非利士人便來住在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人來剝那被殺之人的衣服，看見掃羅和他兒子仆倒在基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就剝了他的軍裝，割下他的首級，打發人到",{"noteId":10},"非利士地的四境報信與他們的偶像和眾民，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又將掃羅的軍裝放在他們神的廟裏，將他的首級釘在大袞廟中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列‧雅比人聽見非利士人向掃羅所行的一切事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們中間所有的勇士就起身前去，將掃羅和他兒子的屍身送到雅比，將他們的屍骨葬在雅比的橡樹下，就禁食七日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["這樣，掃羅死了。因為他干犯耶和華，沒有遵守耶和華的命；又因他求問交鬼的婦人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["沒有求問耶和華，所以耶和華使他被殺，把國歸於耶西的兒子大衛。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"-","text":"到：或譯送到","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}